recursive : same fibonacci hai kyuki number of steps utne hi lag rahe hai jo fibonacci series mein hai 
            Aur agar 5th stair pe khade hai toh uska answer hoga f(4)+f(3) 4th stair tak pahuchne ke jitne tarike hai aur 3rd stair tak pahuchne ke jitne tareeke hai dono ko sum hoga

code: class Solution {
    int climb(int n)
    {
        if(n<=2) return n;
        return climb(n-1)+climb(n-2);
    }
    public int climbStairs(int n) {
        return climb(n);
    }
}
            

